      "impact": "If U2 is populated, the MCU ground pin is connected to the NET0007 analog/sensor net instead of GND, shorting that net to ground through the MCU pin and preventing correct ADC/PB4 operation; the MCU may also lack a proper ground connection depending on how the symbol/footprint is interpreted.",
      "confidence": 0.72
